  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>&nbsp;is getting dissolved, so reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Anode</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>cathode</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></math></p><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ni</mi></math></p>\r\n\\(=0.16+0.05912 \\times 2\\)\r\n\\(=.16+0.0591\\)\r\n\\(=0.21(+\\mathrm{ve})\\)\r\n<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(Non-spontaneous)</p><p>(B)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Fe</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.044</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.40</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.06</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(Spontaneous)</p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pb</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.13</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.24</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.06</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub